WEBVTT

00:00:19.480 --> 00:00:29.830
I'm not a robot, I'm a machine, so I know what's going on.

00:00:36.970 --> 00:00:50.480
to the

00:01:51.660 --> 00:01:52.400
Jonas!

00:02:12.960 --> 00:02:19.760
I'm from the research institute, but Mr. Koji wants you to call him immediately.

00:02:19.760 --> 00:02:23.770
Please get on.

00:02:23.770 --> 00:02:25.550
I'm sorry.

00:02:25.550 --> 00:02:26.280
I'm sorry.

00:02:38.190 --> 00:02:39.830
What are you talking about?

00:02:40.810 --> 00:02:43.930
No, this is not the kind of lab I'm talking about.

00:02:43.970 --> 00:02:48.290
Oh, I'm sorry. I was just thinking about something.

00:02:49.010 --> 00:02:51.150
I don't want to get in the way.

00:02:51.510 --> 00:02:53.550
What are you doing in the lab?

00:02:55.860 --> 00:02:56.960
Hey, miss.

00:02:57.710 --> 00:03:00.000
Don't worry about me, kid.

00:03:12.120 --> 00:03:24.480
The King of Darkness! Are you calling for me? The King of Darkness!

00:03:24.560 --> 00:03:30.000
Great General of Darkness, the Great Majinger's base is under attack.

00:03:30.120 --> 00:03:33.340
-Did you catch it? -I haven't thought about it yet.

00:03:33.430 --> 00:03:36.890
It's also in the hands of Algos, the commander of the intelligence force.

00:03:37.020 --> 00:03:40.020
If we don't get any information, we'll just waste the battle guns.

00:03:40.120 --> 00:03:44.560
General Dark, do you think you can just leave it to Algos?

00:03:44.840 --> 00:03:48.670
I'll tie up your activities with the activities of the spies.

00:03:48.770 --> 00:03:49.940
Yes, sir!

00:03:54.370 --> 00:03:58.080
I think you've been scolded by Algos.

00:03:58.270 --> 00:04:00.000
General Hadeas, the evil spirit!

00:04:00.060 --> 00:04:01.900
Adios!

00:04:03.760 --> 00:04:07.260
Are you calling for me, General?

00:04:07.340 --> 00:04:10.320
We can't wait to hear from Argos.

00:04:10.460 --> 00:04:13.790
We must take him to Mt. Fuji as soon as possible.

00:04:13.940 --> 00:04:16.820
All right, we'll take Zugaru with us.

00:04:16.880 --> 00:04:20.460
If he's the one, we'll be able to take action without being found out.

00:04:21.420 --> 00:04:22.180
Go!

00:04:22.280 --> 00:04:23.300
Don't just stand there.

00:04:23.380 --> 00:04:26.590
Let's grab the base of Great Mazinger as soon as possible!

00:04:26.710 --> 00:04:27.810
Yes, sir.

00:04:34.800 --> 00:04:35.730
We're ready to launch.

00:04:35.730 --> 00:04:37.570
Let's launch it right away!

00:04:37.570 --> 00:04:38.570
Launch!

00:04:38.570 --> 00:04:47.040
Great Shogun.

00:04:47.040 --> 00:04:51.920
Do you think we're going to succeed without our help?

00:04:51.920 --> 00:04:54.160
Let's go, Captain!

00:04:54.160 --> 00:04:55.660
Yes, sir!

00:04:55.660 --> 00:04:58.670
I'm sure our spy activities are going well.

00:04:58.670 --> 00:05:00.000
Don't worry.

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:04.370
General Argos, the Cyborg is already in action.

00:05:04.450 --> 00:05:08.450
I'm sure the Dark General will come to his senses soon.

00:05:08.490 --> 00:05:10.370
Don't get carried away, Go-Gon.

00:05:10.370 --> 00:05:14.000
We must go to Mt. Fuji and take command.

00:05:14.040 --> 00:05:18.040
If Hardius uses the Zugaru to do whatever he wants,

00:05:18.080 --> 00:05:21.110
everything will be in vain.

00:05:21.150 --> 00:05:25.110
Then why don't you take over the Great Maginger base?

00:05:25.150 --> 00:05:27.600
What?

00:05:27.640 --> 00:05:30.000
If I wait for your information, I'll get sick of it.

00:05:30.670 --> 00:05:32.660
I'll take care of it myself!

00:05:32.660 --> 00:05:35.640
That's the dark side of it all.

00:05:41.450 --> 00:05:48.790
YX, YX.

00:05:48.790 --> 00:05:50.760
Captain Gorgon, did you call for me?

00:05:50.760 --> 00:05:52.240
Is the operation going well?

00:05:52.240 --> 00:05:54.440
Yes, the preparations are complete.

00:05:54.440 --> 00:05:58.070
All that's left is to wait for the Great Majinger to trap us.

00:05:58.070 --> 00:06:00.000
Hurry up! The dark side of it all.

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:05.410
The Great Shogun has sent the evil Shogun, Hardias, and the battle beast, Zugarl.

00:06:05.410 --> 00:06:07.610
That's right, my friend.

00:06:07.610 --> 00:06:29.410
Zugarl, the base of the Great Mazinger should be close by.

00:06:31.690 --> 00:06:33.270
This is Spy X.

00:06:33.270 --> 00:06:34.320
What is it?

00:06:34.320 --> 00:06:39.290
We're working on a plan to lure out the Great Majinger.

00:06:39.290 --> 00:06:40.150
All right.

00:06:40.150 --> 00:06:43.440
Then I'll have Zugar watch from the sky!

00:06:43.440 --> 00:06:44.450
Zugar!

00:06:44.450 --> 00:06:50.140
Yugi!

00:06:50.140 --> 00:06:57.360
Captain, look at this!

00:06:57.360 --> 00:07:00.000
Captain!

00:07:00.480 --> 00:07:02.720
I've been getting messages like this all the time.

00:07:02.720 --> 00:07:03.300
What?

00:07:03.300 --> 00:07:06.590
If you want to get Siro back,

00:07:06.590 --> 00:07:11.110
bring the Great Majinger to Fujisanruku Point HQ.

00:07:11.110 --> 00:07:17.100
Siro.

00:07:17.100 --> 00:07:18.920
Chief!

00:07:18.920 --> 00:07:22.670
Is the message that Siro-chan was kidnapped

00:07:22.670 --> 00:07:25.590
really true, Chief?

00:07:25.590 --> 00:07:29.220
But why did they call him the Great Majinger?

00:07:29.220 --> 00:07:30.000
I don't know.

00:07:30.000 --> 00:07:34.770
It seems that there is a trap.

00:07:34.770 --> 00:07:36.760
If Shiro's kidnapping is true,

00:07:36.760 --> 00:07:38.940
then we have to solve this mystery.

00:07:53.000 --> 00:07:53.890
Don't do that!

00:07:53.890 --> 00:07:56.890
This is not a real battle!

00:07:56.890 --> 00:07:57.750
Hey, hey!

00:07:57.750 --> 00:07:58.740
The left turn is slow!

00:07:58.740 --> 00:08:00.000
That's right!

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:03.690
Tetsuya, why don't you call Jun in?

00:08:03.790 --> 00:08:04.570
Yes, sir.

00:08:04.900 --> 00:08:07.220
Hey, Jun, the director wants to see you.

00:08:07.840 --> 00:08:09.940
Director, is something wrong?

00:08:10.040 --> 00:08:12.950
Yes, we're going to let the Buenas Aids out right away.

00:08:13.050 --> 00:08:14.010
What?

00:08:14.110 --> 00:08:15.460
Director, the Buenas Aids...

00:08:15.560 --> 00:08:17.450
Jun is still in training.

00:08:17.550 --> 00:08:20.850
Shiro was kidnapped by someone.

00:08:20.950 --> 00:08:21.830
Shiro?

00:08:21.960 --> 00:08:24.390
We have all the details.

00:08:24.490 --> 00:08:28.170
Tetsuya, while the Buenas Aids are keeping an eye on the enemy,

00:08:28.270 --> 00:08:30.000
you and Shiro are going to...

00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:31.540
I don't think he's going to help us.

00:08:31.540 --> 00:08:37.270
But, Director...

00:08:37.270 --> 00:08:40.500
Jun, we're going to use the Lunas.

00:08:40.500 --> 00:08:41.830
Don't worry about it.

00:08:41.830 --> 00:08:43.750
Our goal is to get to Point A.

00:08:43.750 --> 00:08:44.580
Roger that.

00:08:44.580 --> 00:08:51.670
You're really out of your mind.

00:08:51.670 --> 00:08:55.310
They're telling us to go to Great Mazinger.

00:08:55.310 --> 00:08:56.660
What did you say?

00:09:41.580 --> 00:09:45.080
I'm confident. It's the mountainous area of Point 727.

00:09:45.080 --> 00:09:52.200
Evil Shogun Hardius, the Great Mazinger may appear.

00:09:52.200 --> 00:09:55.480
Please let me go to Point 727.

00:09:55.480 --> 00:09:57.680
I think I can find the base.

00:10:32.720 --> 00:10:36.860
What's wrong with you?

00:10:36.860 --> 00:10:38.860
What are you talking about?

00:10:38.860 --> 00:10:41.030
Look, look, look, look, look!

00:10:41.030 --> 00:10:43.030
I can't see anything!

00:10:43.030 --> 00:10:45.030
No way!

00:10:45.030 --> 00:10:47.490
No, look at that!

00:10:47.490 --> 00:10:50.600
I'm so sick of it!

00:10:50.600 --> 00:10:53.230
What?

00:10:53.230 --> 00:10:55.400
Are you sick of it?

00:10:55.400 --> 00:10:57.280
Boss! Wake up!

00:10:57.280 --> 00:10:59.290
We're going to wake up the Great Bandicoot!

00:10:59.290 --> 00:11:00.000
Boss!

00:11:02.620 --> 00:11:04.360
Hey, why are you so quiet?

00:11:04.360 --> 00:11:05.320
You idiot!

00:11:05.320 --> 00:11:06.280
It's the beauty!

00:11:06.280 --> 00:11:08.720
The absolute beauty has appeared!

00:11:08.720 --> 00:11:10.420
What the hell are you talking about?

00:11:10.420 --> 00:11:24.160
I'm not going to let you get away with this.

00:11:24.160 --> 00:11:26.140
I've been waiting for this chance for a long time.

00:11:26.140 --> 00:11:27.940
White-beard, run!

00:12:24.380 --> 00:12:25.720
You don't understand, Chief.

00:12:26.350 --> 00:12:30.000
The Great Mazinger won't be able to move to save Siro.

00:12:33.230 --> 00:12:34.150
Hurry up and come back.

00:12:34.150 --> 00:12:36.320
It seems that Yunus is struggling.

00:12:36.320 --> 00:12:38.430
He's a pathetic person, Junmo.

00:12:38.430 --> 00:12:39.380
Leave him alone.

00:12:39.380 --> 00:12:41.380
The fight is not limited to winning.

00:12:41.380 --> 00:12:58.320
I'm worried about getting away with this case.

00:13:03.000 --> 00:13:03.970
Are you ready?

00:13:03.970 --> 00:13:07.200
If you don't have any complaints, I'll take you home.

00:13:07.200 --> 00:13:10.980
All right.

00:13:10.980 --> 00:13:13.800
Mr. Tetsuya...

00:13:13.800 --> 00:13:16.470
Hey, what are you doing here?

00:13:16.470 --> 00:13:17.640
Um...

00:13:17.640 --> 00:13:19.970
Come on, don't waste your time.

00:13:19.970 --> 00:13:22.400
Hold on tight.

00:13:22.400 --> 00:13:23.040
Let's go.

00:13:23.040 --> 00:13:23.780
Okay.

00:13:23.780 --> 00:13:29.310
Tetsuya...

00:13:29.310 --> 00:13:30.000
He's...

00:13:30.000 --> 00:13:39.730
Tetsuya, how did he get out? He didn't have great magic. What did he get out of the way? What did he get out of the way?

00:13:39.730 --> 00:13:48.210
I'll catch him.

00:14:01.310 --> 00:14:03.310
What's wrong with that robot?

00:14:03.310 --> 00:14:12.090
Hey, what are you doing?

00:14:12.090 --> 00:14:15.090
Shut up!

00:14:15.090 --> 00:14:17.090
It's Jun who's controlling it.

00:14:17.090 --> 00:14:19.160
All right, now's my chance.

00:14:19.160 --> 00:14:22.820
I'm going to show you the good side of Boss Borot!

00:14:33.040 --> 00:14:35.040
Girls don't do stupid things!

00:14:35.040 --> 00:14:36.860
Leave it to me!

00:14:36.860 --> 00:14:37.880
What are you doing?!

00:14:37.880 --> 00:14:39.820
That's fine, Ju-chan!

00:14:39.820 --> 00:14:42.370
You feel bad, don't you?

00:14:42.370 --> 00:14:44.790
Come on! I'm your opponent!

00:14:50.580 --> 00:14:53.580
If you do it here, you'll be licked by a girl!

00:14:53.580 --> 00:14:54.470
No, no, no, no!

00:14:54.470 --> 00:14:55.470
Show me a good place!

00:14:55.470 --> 00:14:58.280
It's from 180!

00:14:58.280 --> 00:15:00.000
What the hell are you doing?!

00:15:00.570 --> 00:15:01.610
Damn it!

00:15:01.610 --> 00:15:08.360
Hurry to Point 727.

00:15:08.360 --> 00:15:10.520
It seems there's a base in Great Majingua.

00:15:10.520 --> 00:15:21.800
Shino.

00:15:21.800 --> 00:15:24.260
I'm sorry to have worried you.

00:15:24.260 --> 00:15:25.720
You don't have to be so polite.

00:15:25.720 --> 00:15:27.440
It's not like we're short of supplies.

00:15:27.440 --> 00:15:30.000
By the way, what are you going to do about Lunas Ace?

00:15:30.000 --> 00:15:32.880
That's what he's doing to his opponent's battleship.

00:15:32.960 --> 00:15:36.250
He must be aiming for Buenas' base.

00:15:37.850 --> 00:15:41.080
I'll leave it to you, Buenas.

00:15:41.950 --> 00:16:00.000
It's a success. They're all here.

00:16:00.000 --> 00:16:01.880
There's a base for the Great Majingers.

00:16:01.980 --> 00:16:03.800
The Great Majingers, the Great Majingers!

00:16:03.900 --> 00:16:05.910
What's the matter, Spy X?

00:16:06.010 --> 00:16:09.020
It seems that the base for the Great Majingers is being seized.

00:16:09.120 --> 00:16:14.290
What? You're certain? We're going there soon.

00:16:14.390 --> 00:16:16.290
That's the Great Majingers.

00:16:16.390 --> 00:16:19.290
They sent a different message to the Great Majingers,

00:16:19.390 --> 00:16:22.210
and ordered Z'Gal to search for them.

00:16:25.260 --> 00:16:27.040
I don't care. Just leave it.

00:16:27.140 --> 00:16:30.000
If Z'Gal destroys one of their bases,

00:16:30.000 --> 00:16:31.030
It's a beast!

00:16:31.030 --> 00:16:32.650
Yes, I understand.

00:16:48.990 --> 00:16:52.980
Why did you come to this place?

00:16:52.980 --> 00:16:59.260
Projectile, fire!

00:16:59.260 --> 00:16:59.960
Beam, fire!

00:17:08.280 --> 00:17:10.160
At least in front of a woman!

00:17:10.160 --> 00:17:12.010
How noisy!

00:17:12.010 --> 00:17:12.860
Get out of the way!

00:17:12.860 --> 00:17:14.860
Don't say that, Leon!

00:17:14.860 --> 00:17:17.900
Hey, Jun-chan!

00:17:17.900 --> 00:17:19.900
Why are you so cold?

00:17:19.900 --> 00:17:21.730
Get out of the way!

00:17:21.730 --> 00:17:23.440
You're rough!

00:17:23.440 --> 00:17:26.930
Ugh!

00:17:26.930 --> 00:17:29.880
Ugh!

00:17:30.120 --> 00:17:33.600
Ryunas! Your name is Ryunas, isn't it?

00:17:34.160 --> 00:17:40.480
Garu, if you come this far, we'll just have to combine our bodies and fight.

00:17:47.990 --> 00:17:51.040
Ryunas still doesn't seem to be able to fight a fighter.

00:17:53.620 --> 00:17:57.120
If you want to be my partner, you'll have to work a little harder.

00:17:57.700 --> 00:17:59.730
Tetsuya-onii-chan, please do it for me.

00:18:00.540 --> 00:18:03.090
Shut up. Don't talk like that, Chibiya.

00:18:03.180 --> 00:18:06.860
You have to get past the obstacles to become a real man.

00:18:08.280 --> 00:18:11.880
Hey, Jun! Jun! Jun!

00:18:12.160 --> 00:18:14.250
What's wrong?

00:18:15.400 --> 00:18:19.900
Chief, we've been catching an unknown signal for a long time.

00:18:19.980 --> 00:18:20.680
What?

00:18:21.950 --> 00:18:25.950
Chief, it's very close. It looks like a radar transmitter.

00:18:26.010 --> 00:18:27.640
A radar transmitter?

00:18:28.000 --> 00:18:29.190
Hey, Shiro.

00:18:32.750 --> 00:18:34.130
Take off your clothes.

00:18:34.400 --> 00:18:39.570
-I don't want to! -Take them off now!

00:18:39.920 --> 00:18:43.190
What are you doing, Etsuya?

00:18:44.210 --> 00:18:48.500
-Oh! -I'm using this transmitter.

00:18:49.620 --> 00:18:54.090
No! The enemy has already spotted us.

00:18:55.550 --> 00:18:58.850
I should have easily taken you to the castle.

00:18:58.900 --> 00:19:00.000
You should have...

00:19:00.000 --> 00:19:02.210
I'll crush you with all my might!

00:19:02.210 --> 00:19:04.350
Sir, please shut down the lab!

00:19:04.350 --> 00:19:07.010
Hey, Tetsuya-kun!

00:19:30.730 --> 00:19:31.800
Engine start!

00:19:31.800 --> 00:19:48.180
On!

00:19:48.180 --> 00:19:56.010
Granblue!

00:19:56.010 --> 00:19:58.020
Don't shed tears!

00:19:58.020 --> 00:19:59.020
Da-da-da!

00:19:59.020 --> 00:20:00.000
Robot!

00:20:05.630 --> 00:20:07.110
It's that passenger car, isn't it?

00:20:07.170 --> 00:20:09.930
Here's the transmitter. I'll give it to you now!

00:20:10.250 --> 00:20:13.060
♪ With you... ♪

00:20:13.490 --> 00:20:15.250
♪ I'll shoot you... ♪

00:20:15.310 --> 00:20:17.000
♪ I'll shoot you... ♪

00:20:31.630 --> 00:20:52.800
This time, I'm the one who's the opposite!

00:20:52.800 --> 00:20:55.650
Hey, hey, how long are you going to play around?

00:20:55.650 --> 00:21:00.000
This isn't the place for you to come!

00:21:01.210 --> 00:21:03.230
Oh, no!

00:21:03.230 --> 00:21:06.180
Mr. King, you're pretty good, aren't you?

00:21:06.180 --> 00:21:07.500
Well then, let's go!

00:21:07.500 --> 00:21:09.830
Special Punch!

00:21:20.600 --> 00:21:22.690
You're in a hurry, aren't you?

00:21:22.690 --> 00:21:24.360
Spy-X!

00:21:24.360 --> 00:21:26.360
Where's the base of the Red Mazinger?

00:21:26.360 --> 00:21:28.160
Hey, Spy-X!

00:21:28.160 --> 00:21:29.660
Whoa!

00:22:04.800 --> 00:22:05.760
Stop!

00:22:05.760 --> 00:22:22.770
Bajinger!

00:22:22.770 --> 00:22:30.000
You're going to the right place, you bastard!

00:22:30.120 --> 00:22:31.420
I've found the location.

00:22:31.420 --> 00:22:35.360
Now I'll lead the seven troops and crush them all at once.

00:22:35.360 --> 00:22:36.790
Get ready!

00:22:36.790 --> 00:22:42.840
Let's go.

00:22:42.840 --> 00:22:46.730
Jun, did you realize that training and actual combat are different?

00:22:46.730 --> 00:22:48.550
I know that.

00:22:48.550 --> 00:22:50.590
But I'll thank you today.

00:22:50.590 --> 00:22:52.890
I'm in a good mood.

00:22:52.890 --> 00:22:56.590
If you say that, you'll look even worse one day.

00:22:56.590 --> 00:22:58.390
Like that guy.

00:22:58.390 --> 00:23:00.000
-What? -Wait!

00:23:00.320 --> 00:23:01.620
Look at this outfit!

00:23:01.930 --> 00:23:04.670
Why am I the third one to wear this outfit?

00:23:04.750 --> 00:23:05.750
I don't like it!

00:23:09.980 --> 00:23:11.420
What are you doing?

00:23:11.500 --> 00:23:13.640
Why are you laughing?

00:23:45.160 --> 00:23:46.420
I heard it

00:24:33.320 --> 00:24:39.230
A huge mass that fell on the ground was the beginning of Mugarissa's challenge during the battle.

00:24:39.230 --> 00:24:45.080
Moreover, the Science Fortress Research Institute was exposed to the destruction operation by the flying fortress Mikeros.

00:24:45.080 --> 00:24:48.530
Tsurugi Tetsuya, who defeated the Great Mazinger and went on a counterattack,

00:24:48.530 --> 00:24:52.240
fell to a fatal defeat in the face of Mikeros's hurricane.

00:24:52.240 --> 00:24:55.900
Next time on Great Mazinger: Catch and Attack!

00:24:55.900 --> 00:24:58.770
Please look forward to the Science Fortress Research Institute!
